cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the information below."
title: "Fusion Reactor Simulator"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dimensional, time-resolved fusion reactor power-balance simulation engine.
  Models magnetic confinement (tokamak, spherical tokamak, stellarator) and other
  schemes using scaling laws and reaction data from the open literature;
  includes presets for real machines such as ITER, JET, SPARC, DEMO, and W7-X.
type: software
